@startuml 使用案例7_2_使用者登入
title 使用案例7.2: 使用者登入流程

actor "已註冊使用者" as RegisteredUser
participant "Login.vue" as LoginPage
participant "auth.ts" as AuthStore
participant "client.ts" as APIClient
participant "auth.py(blueprint)" as AuthBlueprint
participant "auth_service.py" as AuthService
participant "audit_service.py" as AuditService
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入登入頁面 ==
note over RegisteredUser
  前提條件:
  - 使用者已完成註冊
  - 帳號已通過 Email 驗證
  - 帳號未被鎖定
end note

RegisteredUser -> LoginPage: 訪問「/login」路由
activate LoginPage
LoginPage -> LoginPage: 初始化表單\nemail = '', password = ''
LoginPage -> LoginPage: 顯示登入表單
note right
  顯示內容:
  - Email 輸入框
  - 密碼輸入框
  - "登入" 按鈕
  - "忘記密碼？" 連結
  - "還沒有帳號？立即註冊" 連結
end note
LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示登入頁面
deactivate LoginPage

== 2. 輸入登入資訊 ==
RegisteredUser -> LoginPage: 輸入 Email 和密碼
activate LoginPage
LoginPage -> LoginPage: v-model 雙向綁定\nemail.value, password.value
LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示輸入內容
deactivate LoginPage

== 3. 提交登入表單 ==
RegisteredUser -> LoginPage: 點擊「登入」按鈕
activate LoginPage
LoginPage -> LoginPage: handleLogin()\n@submit.prevent
LoginPage -> LoginPage: unverifiedEmail = ''\n清除未驗證提示

== 4. 呼叫登入 API ==
LoginPage -> AuthStore: authStore.login(\nemail.value, password.value)
activate AuthStore
AuthStore -> APIClient: api.post('/auth/login',\n{ email, password })
activate APIClient
APIClient -> APIClient: 添加 baseURL
APIClient -> AuthBlueprint: POST /auth/login\nBody: { email, password }
activate AuthBlueprint

== 5. 後端驗證欄位 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: data = request.get_json()
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 檢查必填欄位\n(email, password)

alt 缺少必填欄位
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{"message": "Email 和密碼為必填"}
    APIClient --> AuthStore: error (400)
    AuthStore --> LoginPage: error
    LoginPage -> LoginPage: catch error\nalert("登入失敗...")
    LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示錯誤訊息\n(彈窗提示)
    note left: 中斷流程
else 欄位齊全
    AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 取得 email, password
end

== 6. 執行登入驗證 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthService: auth_service.login(\nemail, password)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> UserModel: User.query.filter_by(\nemail=email, deleted_at=None).first()
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE email=:email\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nLIMIT 1
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 或 None
deactivate DB
UserModel --> AuthService: user
deactivate UserModel

alt 用戶不存在
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise UnauthorizedError\n("Email 或密碼錯誤")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 401 Unauthorized\n{"message": "Email 或密碼錯誤"}
    APIClient --> AuthStore: error (401)
    AuthStore --> LoginPage: error
    LoginPage -> LoginPage: alert(error.message)
    LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示錯誤：帳號或密碼錯誤
    note left: 中斷流程
else 用戶存在
    AuthService -> AuthService: 取得 user 物件
end

== 7. 檢查 Email 驗證狀態 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: 檢查 user.verified

alt Email 未驗證
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise PermissionDeniedError\n("請先驗證 Email，或使用重新發送驗證郵件功能")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 403 Forbidden\n{"message": "請先驗證 Email..."}
    APIClient --> AuthStore: error (403)
    AuthStore --> LoginPage: error
    LoginPage -> LoginPage: 檢查 status === 403\n且訊息含有「驗證」
    LoginPage -> LoginPage: unverifiedEmail = email\n顯示重發驗證郵件提示
    LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示黃色提示框\n"您的 Email 還未完成驗證"
    note right
      提示內容:
      - 顯示未驗證的 Email
      - "重新發送驗證郵件" 按鈕
      - "輸入驗證連結" 連結
    end note
    note left: 中斷流程
else Email 已驗證
    AuthService -> AuthService: 繼續登入流程
end

== 8. 檢查帳號鎖定狀態 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: 檢查 user.is_locked

alt 帳號已被鎖定
    AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise PermissionDeniedError\n(f"帳號已被鎖定至 {user.locked_until}")
    AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 403 Forbidden\n{"message": "帳號已被鎖定至..."}
    APIClient --> AuthStore: error (403)
    AuthStore --> LoginPage: error
    LoginPage -> LoginPage: alert(error.message)
    LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示錯誤：帳號已被鎖定
    note left: 中斷流程
else 帳號未鎖定
    AuthService -> AuthService: 繼續驗證密碼
end

== 9. 驗證密碼 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: verify_password(\npassword, user.password_hash)
note right
  使用雜湊比對:
  將輸入的 password 雜湊後
  與資料庫的 password_hash 比對
end note

alt 密碼錯誤
    AuthService -> AuthService: user.failed_login_attempts += 1\n增加失敗次數
    
    alt 失敗次數 >= 5
        AuthService -> AuthService: user.locked_until =\n  now + timedelta(minutes=30)\n鎖定帳號 30 分鐘
        AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()\n更新鎖定狀態
        activate DB
        DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
        deactivate DB
        
        AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise UnauthorizedError\n("Email 或密碼錯誤")
        AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 401 Unauthorized\n{"message": "Email 或密碼錯誤"}
        note right
          實際上帳號已被鎖定
          但錯誤訊息不透露細節
          避免帳號探測攻擊
        end note
        APIClient --> AuthStore: error (401)
        AuthStore --> LoginPage: error
        LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示錯誤：密碼錯誤\n(已鎖定但不明說)
        note left: 中斷流程
    else 失敗次數 < 5
        AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()\n更新失敗次數
        activate DB
        DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
        deactivate DB
        
        AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: raise UnauthorizedError\n("Email 或密碼錯誤")
        AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 401 Unauthorized
        APIClient --> AuthStore: error (401)
        AuthStore --> LoginPage: error
        LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示錯誤：密碼錯誤\n(剩餘 5-n 次機會)
        note left: 中斷流程
    end
else 密碼正確
    AuthService -> AuthService: 登入成功，準備生成 Token
end

== 10. 登入成功處理 ==
AuthService -> AuthService: user.failed_login_attempts = 0\nuser.locked_until = None\nuser.last_login_at = now
note right
  重置登入失敗狀態:
  - 清除失敗次數
  - 清除鎖定時間
  - 更新最後登入時間
end note

AuthService -> DB: db.session.commit()\n更新用戶狀態
activate DB
DB --> AuthService: 提交成功
deactivate DB

== 11. 生成 JWT Token ==
AuthService -> AuthService: create_access_token(\nidentity=str(user.user_id))
AuthService -> AuthService: create_refresh_token(\nidentity=str(user.user_id))
note right
  JWT Token:
  - access_token: 短期有效 (例如 15 分鐘)
  - refresh_token: 長期有效 (例如 30 天)
  - identity: 用戶 ID
end note

== 12. 記錄審計日誌 ==
AuthService -> AuditService: audit_service.log_login(\nuser.user_id, success=True)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\nVALUES (action='user.login', ...)
activate DB
DB --> AuditService: 記錄成功
deactivate DB
AuditService --> AuthService: 審計完成
deactivate AuditService

AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: return (user, access_token, refresh_token)
deactivate AuthService

== 13. 回傳登入結果 ==
AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 200 OK\n{\n  "message": "登入成功",\n  "access_token": "eyJ...",\n  "refresh_token": "eyJ...",\n  "user": { user_id, email, role, ... }\n}
deactivate AuthBlueprint
APIClient --> AuthStore: response.data
deactivate APIClient

== 14. 儲存認證資訊 ==
AuthStore -> AuthStore: 解構 response.data\naccess_token, refresh_token, user
AuthStore -> AuthStore: accessToken.value = access_token\nrefreshToken.value = refresh_token\nuser.value = userData
AuthStore -> AuthStore: localStorage.setItem(\n  'access_token', access_token)\nlocalStorage.setItem(\n  'refresh_token', refresh_token)\nlocalStorage.setItem(\n  'user', JSON.stringify(userData))
note right
  將認證資訊存入:
  1. Pinia Store (記憶體)
  2. LocalStorage (持久化)
  
  下次瀏覽器開啟時
  可自動載入登入狀態
end note

AuthStore --> LoginPage: 登入成功
deactivate AuthStore

== 15. 導向首頁 ==
LoginPage -> LoginPage: router.push('/')
LoginPage --> RegisteredUser: 導向至首頁 (/)
deactivate LoginPage

RegisteredUser -> RegisteredUser: 以登入狀態使用系統
note left
  登入成功後:
  - 可查看個人資料
  - 可發佈送養
  - 可提交領養申請
  - 可管理自己的內容
  
  根據角色 (role) 顯示不同功能:
  - GENERAL_MEMBER: 一般會員功能
  - SHELTER_MEMBER: 收容所管理功能
  - ADMIN: 系統管理功能
end note

@enduml